<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>MindQuest | Interactive Emotional Learning</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <!-- Simple text-only navigation; no links or functionality yet. -->
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="container"><strong class="brand">MindQuest</strong></div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <!-- Homepage introduction -->
    <section class="hero container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Interactive emotional learning</p>
      <h1>Helping young minds grow, one quest at a time.</h1>
      <p class="intro">MindQuest is a future interactive platform designed to help therapists guide children through emotional awareness, coping skills, and healthier thinking patterns.</p>
      <p class="note">A playful approach to meaningful learning, built to support therapist-guided activities.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Text-only overview of the planned activities -->
    <section class="section-soft">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Explore the idea</h2>
        <p>Simple, engaging activities that make important emotional skills easier to practice.</p>
        <div class="topics">
          <div class="topic"><h3>Thought Karate</h3><p>Practice noticing unhelpful thoughts and building more balanced ones.</p></div>
          <div class="topic"><h3>Emotion Detective</h3><p>Explore everyday situations and learn to recognize feelings.</p></div>
          <div class="topic"><h3>Calm Quest</h3><p>Discover breathing and relaxation techniques for moments of stress.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Future vision; no dashboard or working features yet. -->
    <section class="container closing">
      <h2>Designed with therapists in mind</h2>
      <p>Our long-term vision is to give professionals customizable activities and simple ways to support children's emotional learning.</p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer"><div class="container">MindQuest — An early project concept</div></footer>
</body>
</html>
